1
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:02,850
W: Hello, sir, how can I be of service to you today?

2
00:00:03,335 --> 00:00:06,710
M: Hi, my name is John Smith, and I am here to check in.

3
00:00:07,265 --> 00:00:11,095
I made a reservation for a single room for two nights three days ago.

4
00:00:11,595 --> 00:00:13,415
W: Ah... yes, Mr. Smith.

5
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:15,015
We've been expecting you.

6
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:19,775
I can see here that you requested a non-smoking room overlooking Lake Huron.

7
00:00:20,135 --> 00:00:24,725
You've also asked for your breakfast meal to be served in your room at 7 a.m. sharp, right?

8
00:00:25,015 --> 00:00:26,315
M: Yes, that is correct.

9
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:34,055
I have to make a presentation at a business seminar at 9, so I want to have some time to read over the materials beforehand.
